<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Listing Policy | Springs Local Small Businesses</title>

  <style>
    :root {
      --navy: #102a43;
      --navy-dark: #071c2e;
      --blue: #1769aa;
      --soft: #f6f9fc;
      --line: #d9e2ec;
      --text: #1d2939;
      --muted: #667085;
      --white: #ffffff;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--text);
      background: var(--soft);
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    a { color: var(--blue); }

    .container {
      width: min(850px, calc(100% - 32px));
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .header {
      padding: 18px 0;
      color: var(--white);
      background: var(--navy-dark);
    }

    .header-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .brand {
      color: var(--white);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 900;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 10px 14px;
      color: var(--navy);
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: 9px;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    main { padding: 48px 0 64px; }

    article {
      padding: 32px;
      background: var(--white);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 16px;
    }

    h1, h2 { color: var(--navy); }
    h1 { margin-top: 0; }
    h2 { margin-top: 30px; font-size: 1.3rem; }
    .updated { color: var(--muted); }

    footer {
      padding: 28px 0;
      color: #c7d7e4;
      background: var(--navy-dark);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 560px) {
      article { padding: 22px; }
      .header-row { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <header class="header">
    <div class="container header-row">
      <a class="brand" href="./index.html">Springs Local Small Businesses</a>
      <a class="button" href="./index.html">Return to Directory</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="container">
      <article>
        <h1>Directory Listing Policy</h1>
        <p class="updated">Last updated: October 1, 2026</p>

        <p>
          Springs Local Small Businesses aims to provide useful, accurate local-business listings.
          Business applications are reviewed before publication, but listing approval is not a
          guarantee of service quality or a certification by a government agency.
        </p>

        <h2>Free applications and listings</h2>
        <p>
          Businesses may apply to be listed at no charge. Submission of an application does not
          guarantee approval, placement, ranking, or continued display in the directory.
        </p>

        <h2>Review process</h2>
        <p>
          We review submitted information for completeness, relevance, and apparent accuracy. We may
          contact an applicant, request additional information, clarify a service description, or
          decline an application at our discretion.
        </p>

        <h2>Accurate information</h2>
        <p>
          Businesses are responsible for ensuring that submitted information is accurate, current,
          and lawful. This includes contact details, service descriptions, service area, website
          links, credential claims, and any statements about licensing, insurance, bonding, or experience.
        </p>

        <h2>Service categories</h2>
        <p>
          Listings are assigned to categories based on the exact services a business provides.
          We may edit service wording or category placement to improve search accuracy. A business
          should not appear in a category for services it does not actually offer.
        </p>

        <h2>Credentials and claims</h2>
        <p>
          Businesses must not claim to be licensed, insured, bonded, certified, or otherwise
          credentialed unless the claim is true and can be supported. Customers should independently
          verify credentials relevant to their project before hiring a business.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes and removal</h2>
        <p>
          A business may request a correction or removal of its listing by contacting us. We may
          update, suspend, archive, or remove any listing that is inaccurate, outdated, misleading,
          inactive, unlawful, receives credible complaints, or does not follow this policy.
        </p>

        <h2>Report a concern</h2>
        <p>
          To report an inaccurate listing, impersonation, or other concern, email
          <a href="mailto:springsbusinesses@gmail.com">springsbusinesses@gmail.com</a>.
          Include the business name, a description of the concern, and any helpful supporting information.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="container">
      © <span id="year"></span> Springs Local Small Businesses
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    document.querySelector("#year").textContent = new Date().getFullYear();
  </script>
</body>
</html>
